@allure.link:http://anamta.primeerp.top.local/admin/indexyii.php?r=accounts2/CashReceiptCV
@allure.label.epic:accounts

Feature: Add Bank Receipt

@critical
Scenario: Create Bank Receipt
    Given we visit "accounts2/CashReceiptCV"        
        and we select "SUSEN FACTORY 2" in "accountCustomerId" autocomplete
        and we select "SusenZamzama" in "venueId"
        and we enter "80" in "partySerialNo"
        and we fill the grid with:
              | Order Id | Account/Customer | Detail  | Debit      | Credit | Cost Center | Chq.# | Venue  |
              |          |  AK              | test    | 100,000.00 | .00    |             |       |        |

      when we click "Save" button
      Then we should see success message
      and we should see this entry in grid:
        | accountCustomerId | Detailnew  |
        | SUSEN FACTORY 2   | test       |

@critical
Scenario: Edit Account Voucher
#    Given we set model prefix to "accounts"

    Given we visit "accounts2/CashReceiptCV"
        when we edit the top row
        then we should see "SUSEN FACTORY 2" in "accountCustomerId"
        then we should see "SusenZamzama" in "venueId"
        then we should see "80" in "partySerialNo"
        then we should see the following in grid:
              | Order Id | Account/Customer | Detail  | Debit      | Credit | Cost Center | Chq.# | Chq. Dt.| Venue  |
              |          |  AK              | test    | 100,000.00 | .00    |             |       |         |        |

@critical
Scenario: Update Account Voucher
#    Given we set model prefix to "accounts"

    Given we visit "accounts2/CashReceiptCV"        
        when we edit the top row
        and we select "CV" in "TransTypeId" 
        and we select "MBL/001 \ Bank A/C" in "accountCustomerId" autocomplete
        and we select "SusenTariqRoad" in "venueId"
        and we enter "81" in "partySerialNo"
        and we fill the grid with:
              | Order Id | Account/Customer         | Detail  | Debit      | Credit | Cost Center | Chq.# | Venue  |
              |          | S TAX \ UTILITY EXPENSES | TEST1   | 200,000    | .00    |             |       |        |

      when we click "Save" button
      Then we should see success message
      and we should see this entry in grid:
        | accountCustomerId  | Detailnew |
        | MBL/001 \ Bank A/C | TEST1     |

  @critical
  Scenario: Delete Account Voucher
      Given we visit "accounts2/CashReceiptCV"
      when we store the top row's DOC Id
          and we delete the top row
      then we should not see the stored Doc Id

